== Trivia ==
* The item is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Shield of the Trinity|Shield of the Trinity]].
* This item is used in {{chal|I RULE!}} and {{chal|Isaac's Awakening}}.
* Although this item is normally only available in the {{r|Angel Room}}, it can be found as one of the Nintendo-themed {{r|Treasure Room}} items in the 6th of December's [[List of curated daily challenges|Daily Run]], which is an homage to the late CEO of Nintendo, Satoru Iwata.
** Its appearance in this challenge references the Hylian shield from The Legend of Zelda series.

